            text: _("<i>_ Konrad, Delfador, and their army wandered for days, lost in lonely corridors and abandoned tunnels under the trackless mountains. What few foodstuffs had been salvaged from the lava dwindled, then vanished entirely. For the first time Konrad saw signs of fatigue in the old wizard’s normally inscrutable face.</i>"),
