        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("We are allies only of convenience, cousin, and it is not in my best interest for you or your rebels to be too well-supplied."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("It’s not “unfortunate” — your mother was more than willing to see you killed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Asheviere gave Mirya the orders she thought were necessary to prevent you from escaping. Whether they were wise orders or not is immaterial; she acted to ensure that Wesnoth survives, even if I don’t. I cannot fault her for that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("She acted to ensure her power remains unchallenged, you mean. The dark queen cares only for herself."),
          },
        ],
