                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Iliah-Malal%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-mad.webp",
            text: _("Time to put you and your lies back in the ground!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_120",
        on: "branch_if_120",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "bm_s14_fought_burlin",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1a",
            value: "You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs! I was there — it is only by my sword that Gryphon Mountain was not entirely ruined!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1b",
            value: "—no, that can’t be right. I was told we’d decided against the egg expedition, because of the intelligence of gryphons and the risks to their population.",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message2",
            value: "Or what of how Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs? Without my intervention Gryphon Mountain might have been entirely ruined!",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_121",
        on: "branch_if_121",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
