      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_119",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Iliah-Malal%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%2C%24lisar_side%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Iliah-Malal",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_Eye of elf and bone of beast...</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("A lich! So here is the source of the undead. Something about this magic feels familiar... very familiar..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Iliah-Malal",
            text: _("Hello, Delfador! Do you remember me? You’ve grown old. Perhaps you regret passing up the temptations of necromancy, so long ago?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("Iliah-Malal! A name most foul, and one that I have not spoken aloud since our duel so many years ago. You’ll recall that I won. You should be dead and gone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Iliah-Malal",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.name",
                value: "Iliah-Malal",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Iliah-Malal",
            text: _("Dead, yes, but not quite gone. You have the good queen to thank for my return. And I have you to thank for finding the Sceptre of Fire! Soon it will be mine."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("I know my own mother, lich, and she would never be complicit in the resurrection of an abomination like yourself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1a",
            value: "You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere passed control of Elensefar to the orcish hordes when she found she could not bend the populace to her will. I was there — it is only by my sword that the entire city was not enslaved!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1b",
            value: "—no, that can’t be right. I was told that the city was under the control of royal forces; the orcs were only supposed to aid in the attack.",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message2",
            value: "Or what of how Asheviere gave control of Elensefar to the orcish hordes when she found she could not bend the populace to her will? Without my intervention the entire city would have been enslaved!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1a",
            value: "You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck on the Peninsula of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west. I was there — it is only by my sword that Muff Malal was killed!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1b",
            value: "—no, that can’t be right. I was told that you rebels were the ones who invited the necromancer in, and that royal forces were beaten back when they came to render aid.",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message2",
            value: "Or what of how Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck on the Peninsula of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west? Without my intervention the entire coast might have been overrun!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1a",
            value: "You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay of Pearls, to enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her enrichment. I was there — it is only by my sword that they were freed!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message1b",
            value: "—no, that can’t be right. I was told the orcs were protecting the merfolk against the rebels, not holding them as slaves.",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "message2",
            value: "Or what of how Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay of Pearls, to enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her enrichment? Without my intervention they might never have been freed!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_120",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_121",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "malal_sighted",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
