          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("But you heard my truths about Asheviere — and Malal’s. The dark queen has already harmed countless lives, and will bring all that we love to ruin if we do not stop her. If you are willing, I would welcome your aid in my fight to make Wesnoth a better place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("My mother has her flaws, but the crimes of which you’ve accused her... I spent my entire childhood listening to my mother give orders and commanding armies around. I’d always given her the benefit of the doubt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("But I cannot deny there have been signs. I became my mother’s most trusted aide-de-camp. I was sent to quiet the worst of the various rebellions. Of course they fought back. I was never told who most of these people were or why they fought my mother. Now the volcano, and now this lich..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
